{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06298","headline":"舟行入剡 · 崔颢","name":"舟行入剡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣棹下东阳，回舟入剡乡。\n青山行不尽，绿水去何长。\n地气秋仍湿，江风晚渐凉。\n山梅犹作雨，谿橘未知霜。\n谢客文逾盛，林公未可忘。\n多惭越中好，流恨阅时芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}